579:  "Marginal bands: first 500 axles at $600, next 1,500 at $500, above 2,000 at $375. Site axis: $45,000 per additional site per year, first site included. Three worked examples (500/1 site = $300,000; 1,000/3 sites = $640,000; 5,000/20 sites = $3,030,000), the corridor arithmetic showing geography can be roughly half the annual cost of a corridor deployment, and the rollover arithmetic ending at $810,000 net over three production years. Also carries the optional performance component (§4A): 3% of a corroborated prevented-failure cost, capped at 33% of base, offered only by election and never during a pilot.");
612:  "Twelve-month term from the Commissioning Date, $370,000 total, evaluation criteria that are explicitly not performance guarantees, and fees confirmed against A2 §5.1. D02 contains no precedence clause of its own — D00's ladder governs, because an index pointing at a clause that does not exist is the same dangling-reference failure the docket exists to prevent.");
