38	doc.push(P("An open counsel decision, correctly labelled as open. The section now says what must be decided, who decides and by when, that Texas is an expectation rather than a term, and what happens if an Order is executed while it is open. It must still be closed by signed addendum before first execution. Q6 is explicit that this is not a formation question and that entity choice does not answer it."));
